<% content_for :title, "Introduction — shadcnrb" %>

<div class="space-y-6">
  <div class="space-y-2">
    <%= sui.h1 "Introduction" %>
    <%= sui.lead "shadcn/ui components for Rails, exposed as an ActionView builder. You own the code. Real Rails helpers underneath." %>
  </div>

  <%= sui.separator %>

  <div class="space-y-3">
    <%= sui.h2 "What is this?" %>
    <%= sui.p do %>
      <%= sui.code "shadcnrb" %> is a Ruby port of
      <a href="https://ui.shadcn.com" class="underline underline-offset-4 font-medium" target="_blank">shadcn/ui</a>,
      built for Rails (7.1+) with Tailwind v4. Components are plain Ruby modules mixed into a
      <%= sui.code "Shadcnrb::Builder" %> object,
      accessible in every view as <%= sui.code "sui" %>.
    <% end %>
    <%= sui.p do %>
      Under the hood, every actionable component wraps the corresponding Rails helper —
      so <%= sui.code "sui.button_to" %> is a real
      <%= sui.code "button_to" %> with CSRF + Turbo,
      <%= sui.code "sui.link_to" %> is a real
      <%= sui.code "link_to" %>, and so on.
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-3">
    <%= sui.h2 "Philosophy" %>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <li><strong>You own the code.</strong> The installer copies components into your app — edit them however you like.</li>
      <li><strong>Rails-native.</strong> Every component mirrors the Rails helper it wraps. No custom <%= sui.code "href:" %> kwarg; use real route helpers.</li>
      <li><strong>One dir per component.</strong> Markup, Tailwind classes, and Stimulus controller all live together in <%= sui.code "app/components/shadcnrb/<name>/" %>.</li>
      <li><strong>Portal pattern for overlays.</strong> Toasts, dialogs, drawers inject into <%= sui.code "document.body" %> — no wrapping controllers.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-3">
    <%= sui.h2 "Quick example" %>
    <%= live_example do %>
      <%= sui.button "Save", variant: :default %>
    <% end %>
    <%= live_example do %>
      <%= sui.button_to "Delete", "#", method: :delete, variant: :destructive %>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-3">
    <%= sui.h2 "Next steps" %>
    <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
      <li>→ <%= link_to "Installation", docs_installation_path, class: "underline underline-offset-4 font-medium" %></li>
      <li>→ <%= link_to "Browse components", docs_component_path("button"), class: "underline underline-offset-4 font-medium" %></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
